<title>USA: Quixote unit forms DVD marketing division.</title>
<headline>Quixote unit forms DVD marketing division.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quixote Corp said Friday its wholly-owned subsidiary, Disc Manufacturing Inc, formed a new division to focus on marketing its mastering and disc making capabilities for digital versatile disc (DVD) technologies.</p>
<p>With DVD, users can watch digital full-length movies with digital audio from compact discs.</p>
<p>The company said DVD is expected to be introduced in late 1996.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
